# Sequence Diagram - Attestation Generation

```eraser
sequence
    participant HR as HR User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant API as Spring Boot API
    participant Service as AttestationService
    participant Template as TemplateService
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant JR as JasperReports
    participant FS as File System

    HR->Frontend: Select employee & attestation type
    Frontend->API: POST /api/attestations
    API->Service: generateAttestation(attestationDto)
    
    Service->DB: Find employee by ID
    DB-->>Service: Return employee data
    
    Service->Template: Get template by type
    Template->DB: Find template by name
    DB-->>Template: Return JRXML template
    Template-->>Service: Return template content
    
    Service->JR: Compile JRXML template
    JR-->>Service: Return compiled template
    
    Service->JR: Fill template with employee data
    JR-->>Service: Generate PDF bytes
    
    Service->FS: Save PDF to pdfs/ folder
    Service->DB: Save attestation record
    DB-->>Service: Confirm save
    
    Service-->>API: Return success response
    API-->>Frontend: Return success + file info
    Frontend-->>HR: Show success notification
    
    note over HR,FS: PDF is now available for download
```